OL,3,ALargest British study to check social
OL,4,Amedia ban's effect on youth mental
OL,5,Ahealth
OL,6,
OL,7,FMore than 300,000 young people in
OL,8,FBritain will work with researchers to
OL,9,Fhelp understand how the UK's
OL,10,Fforthcoming social media ban for
OL,11,Funder-16s could affect mental health.
OL,13,FThe studies will examine the habits of
OL,14,Fthe children and teenagers, including
OL,15,Fwhether they spend less time on their
OL,16,Fphones and what they are replacing
OL,17,Fscrolling with.
OL,19,FTen different projects have been
OL,20,Fcommissioned, taking place across
OL,21,FEngland, Wales and Scotland, to help
OL,22,Freflect a diverse range of teenagers.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
