OL,3,ALargest British study to check social
OL,4,Amedia ban's effect on youth mental
OL,5,Ahealth
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe social media ban, beginning in
OL,8,Fspring 2027, will follow a similar
OL,9,Fmodel to that already introduced in
OL,10,FAustralia to stop children accessing
OL,11,Fplatforms such as Instagram, TikTok and
OL,12,FSnapchat.
